  "id": "target-food-court-promotion-2004",
  "name": "Target food court promotion (2004)",
  "category": "retailer_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "From February 2004 a medium drink at a Target food court came with one of four promos, Treecko 016, Torchic 017, Mudkip 018 or Whismur 019, each packed with a coupon for a free four-card frame with the purchase of three EX products. The same food courts had entry forms for a Kids' WB contest to draw the art of a Pokémon card. These copies are non-holo, dated 2003, with the e-Reader strip; holofoil reprints dated 2004, without the strip, later came one to a tin in the four EX Deck Tins. Kagemaru Himeno drew all four, and each first came in Japan in a 7-Eleven Pokémon Fair campaign.",
